 fixture changes.\par\pard\li0\fi0\sa100\f0\fs21\cf0 Normal investigations are read-only against Neo4j; graph import is a separate explicit operation.\par\pard\sb300\sa120\keepn\f0\fs28\cf1\b 13. Current limitations and roadmap\b0\par\pard\li0\fi0\sa100\f0\fs21\cf0 The project is a strong prototype for evidence-backed dependency analysis, but its boundaries are explicit.\par\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\cellx2300\cellx6400\clcbpat2\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf4\b Current boundary\b0\cell\clcbpat2\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf4\b Recommended next step\b0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\cellx2300\cellx6400\clcbpat1\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf0 Recommended next step\cell\clcbpat1\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf0 Synthetic entities and simplified components\cell\row\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\cellx2300\cellx6400\clcbpat3\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf0 Connect governed operational master data and document data lineage\cell\clcbpat3\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf0 Full bounded snapshot\cell\row\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\cellx2300\cellx6400\clcbpat1\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf0 Implement scoped Neo4j queries for larger graphs\cell\clcbpat1\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf0 Potential exposure only\cell\row\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\cellx2300\cellx6400\clcbpat3\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf0 Add inventory, capacity, lead time, demand, and financial measures\cell\clcbpat3\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf0 No simultaneous-disruption model\cell\row\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\cellx2300\cellx6400\clcbpat1\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf0 Add scenario composition and interaction rules\cell\clcbpat1\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf0 No authentication / multi-user controls\cell\row\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\cellx2300\cellx6400\clcbpat3\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf0 Add identity, authorization, tenant isolation, and audit logging\cell\clcbpat3\clvertalt\pard\intbl\sa50\f0\fs18\cf0 Evidence validator checks IDs, not semantic 